{"sourceUrl":"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzMTA5","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:01.046814+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/post/detail/Z3MzMTA5","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/gs/web/cn/article/2025/04/e07bd9c753514582a1b3799cb02832e1.jpg\"/></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>活动简介</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>国内外顶尖教授亲临授课、医疗机器人领域前沿内容</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，日前，由上海交通大学医疗机器人研究院主办，第</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>七</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>届医疗机器人国际暑期学校报名即将</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>开始</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>柔性医疗机器人、高通量手术机器人、磁共振诊断治疗、心脏外科手术、医学图像处理、微纳机器人</span><span>......来自中、美、德、英等全球</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>10余位医疗机器人、影像领域的国内外顶尖科学家，知名学者组成“授课团”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，融合科学前沿开展集中授课与实践。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>面向全球</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，暑期学校将从申请者中遴选</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>中国大陆以及海外生</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>物医学工程、控制科学与工程、材料科学与工程、机械工程、计算机科学与技术及相关交叉学科的硕士生和博士生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>本次暑期学校将于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span><span>—7月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>在上海交通大学闵行校区</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>及上海市同仁医院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>举行。以国际化、融合交叉为特色，本次暑期学校将以讲座、研讨会、文化体验等方式，为优秀学生提供直接与医疗机器人及智能影像领域顶尖学者面对面交流、与不同文化背景的青年学者共同切磋的平台。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>已经开启</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>！截止时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>北京时间</span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span>6月2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span><span>24:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>留学交大申请截止时间：</span><span>2025年6月10日24:00）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>遴选结果预计</span><span>6月25日以邮件方式通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/gs/web/cn/article/2025/04/99c056dd0ef52e4225a2c3503941bac0.jpg\"/></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> <img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/gs/web/cn/article/2025/04/bba1c8a297cb92ee435da4732f6e337c.jpg\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/gs/web/cn/article/2025/04/f2c1a8dc96c07f0ec5f3db87324038ec.jpg\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/storage/gs/web/cn/article/2025/04/1184a9d7fce47dc20f55307c675feb44.jpg\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>申请人条件</span></span></span></span><br/><span><span><span><span>(1) 名额：30名</span></span></span></span><br/><span><span><span><span>(2)全球范围内，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>生物医学工程、控制科学与工程、材料科学与工程、机械工程、计算机科学与技术</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>及相关交叉学科的在读硕士研究生、博士研究生、博后，特别优秀的本科生可以破格录取。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）发送个人简历、成绩单等辅助材料（邮件主题：【暑期学校】+姓名）至</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>yushanwu0311@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>非中国籍学生需额外通过留学交（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://apply.sjtu.edu.cn/c.asp?action=sign\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><u><span><span><span><span><span>apply.sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></u></span></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）大申请。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>2）本次报名和简历收取截止时间为北京时间202</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span>6月2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span><span>24：00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>非中国籍学生网络申请截止时间为</span><span>2025年6月10日24:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>上海交通大学研究生院、生物医学工程学院及医疗机器人</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>研究院将根据报名学生的个人情况进行筛选，于北京时间</span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span><span>6月25日24：00前邮件通知学生录取结果。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>费用说明</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>暑期学校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>免收学费</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，提供参加学校活动的餐食，并协助预定住宿，住宿费和交通费用自理</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>联系人</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>吴老师</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>Email: yushanwu0311@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>Tel: +86 021-34204311</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>顾运副教授</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:yungu@ieee.org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span><span>yungu@ieee.org</span></span></span></u></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","textSha256":"996d61ab06d930ec11ccbbe1574e9fb2cb237377131fd4ff008e4ad6aff594f5","textLength":934,"sourceSha256":"7ab4e16ad1a2fff658027f0df351560d8756e4b80e24049f509cd8c097375edf","selector":".mce-content-body","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7a0696cf1b05617f78a6","title":"2025年上海交通大学医疗机器人研究院第七届医疗机器人国际暑期学校学员招募","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:01.046814+00:00"}
